7377 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Explanation of the key issues your PiTech organization addresses\056\n\nCurrently\054 IDD residents living in group homes are widely supported by DSPs \050direct support professionals\051\056 While it helps them to function independently \050of their family\051\054 it often stifles expressions of autonomy and dignity\054 as they have to share the privacy of their homes for many essential functions \050cooking\054 showering\054 etc\051\056 CFS\031s vision for \034Smart Homes\035 would be to shift to \034as\055needed\035 support\054 instead of \03424\0577\035 \055 DSPs shifting to assistive roles\054 reacting to detected emergencies \050e\056g\056 water overfill\051 as opposed to being there \034just\055in\055case\035\056 So\054 the main issues relate to balancing safety and dignity in these group home environments\056)
     /K [ 2033 ]
     /P 7378 0 R
     /Pg 3315 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

