7383 0 obj
  << /ActualText (high\055level goal\072 to explore and implement ways to automate certain \050functions currently managed by support staff\056 \nThe project\047s scope is broad\054 including\072 \nto identify residents\047 needs that can be met through technology\nto select and integrate suitable technical solutions \050e\056g\056 sensors that detect room occupancy to automatically manage lighting\054 etc\051\nto design technical architecture for integrating these sensors\054 through a centralized hub and remote server support\nto design \034thoughtful escalation\035 alerting system for possible accidents \050e\056g\056 first notify the resident through an email\054 then notify the remote support\054 then the family members\054 etc\051\056 \nto develop communication and education materials for the stakeholders \050CFS executives\054 family members\054 support professionals\054 etc\051 \nto develop an evaluation plan\056)
     /K [ 2036 ]
     /P 7384 0 R
