  << /ActualText (Value the whole human\nWe prioritize understanding\054 patience\054 and empathy both internally and externally\056 With the goal of building accessible and inclusive products\054 we foster relationships between our staff and the housing justice community\056 While we remain dedicated to responding to the urgent needs of renters\054 we prioritize our employee\031s well\055being above quick execution\056)
