8369 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Initially staffed by Co\055Founders Bert MacLeech and Pearl Maze MacLeech alone\054 their pilot program served just seven people\056 According to Bert\054 from its very beginning YAI has been dedicated to providing innovative services for the I\057DD\240community\056 MacLeech envisioned a \034total life adjustment approach\054 emphasizing personal growth\054 social responsibility\054 employment goals\054 and the development of independence for the individual\056\035 At a time when institutional living was the norm for people with I\057DD\054 this vision was nothing short of revolutionary\056)
